Package: mariner
Type: Package
Title: Streamline Quarto Report Generation and Bundling for Dr. Seaman's Classes
Version: 0.2.0
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Thomas", "Reinke",
      email = "thomas_reinke1@baylor.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides a set of functions to simplify and automate the
    process of rendering and packaging Quarto documents. The package
    allows users to generate multiple reports from a single parameterized
    template and to bundle Quarto files along with their outputs, such
    as PDFs, TeX files, and purled R scripts, into a single, easily
    shareable zip archive. It also carries a complete Baylor-branded Quarto
    pdf theme, with bundled fonts and a palette validated for contrast and
    colour-vision separation, so reports are styled and their figures drawn
    from the same colours as the page without anything to install separately.
